Also, note that some items that an advanced player would never wish for, 
because there are better items, are still quite powerful at lower 
levels.

A beginning player would normally be at the lower levels of the dungeon, 
and even less-powerful items can still give a character an enormous 
boost.

For example, for a level 30 character, the +3 iron skull cap the 
original poster mentioned wouldn't be particular useful, but for a first 
level character, it makes a world of difference.

Of course, as someone else already mentioned, as time goes by, you will 
occasionally happen upon nice, magical items. Remember those for when 
you next get a wish.

